Third-party data
----------------
data/source_prompts.json reproduces the 313-prompt StrongREJECT benchmark
(Souly et al., 2024, arXiv:2402.10260).

  Source repository: https://github.com/alexandrasouly/strongreject
  (maintained continuation: https://github.com/dsbowen/strong_reject)

StrongREJECT releases its code and custom-generated prompts under the MIT
License, reproduced below. Dataset questions sourced from prior work remain
under their original licenses; the `source` field in source_prompts.json
records that upstream provenance (including AdvBench, HarmfulQ,
MaliciousInstruct, DAN, MasterKey, and others). Refer to the StrongREJECT
repository for the authoritative per-source licensing.

The `category`, `source`, and `forbidden_prompt` fields are reproduced from
StrongREJECT. The `index` field is added by this work as a stable join key.

